openEHR-EHR-CLUSTER.xds_metadata.v0.adl: archetype of the CatSalut CKM (Departament de Salut de la Generalitat de Catalunya),
as provided by the project owner as a regression case. It reuses the id of the international archetype with
different node codes (Health care facility type is at0032, not at0007).

